      "description": "Update theoretical_framework.md to include at least two new proposed mechanisms (e.g., electron-phonon coupling in ternary hydrides, magnetic pairing in nickelates) with supporting equations or references.",
      "expectedFiles": ["theoretical_framework.md", "docs/theoretical_framework.md"]
    },
    {
      "description": "Update candidate_materials.md with at least three new promising compound families (e.g., LaH10, YNiO3, C-S-H) including predicted Tc, crystal structure, and synthesis conditions.",
      "expectedFiles": ["candidate_materials.md", "docs/candidate_materials.md"]
